{
 "ch02": {
  "title": "The Signal",
  "pages": [
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "University of Conakry. First class."
       }
      ],
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Graphs are the absolute core of algorithms. Take good notes."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Nobody talking about yesterday? The Shadow, the blank signs... nothing?"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "You. The guy from Madina. You punched the Oblivion barehanded."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#8b5cf6"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "You SAW it?!"
       }
      ],
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "!?"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "text": "OBLIVION · ATTACKS · 7 DAYS"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "I've been tracking it for a month. It strikes where nobody revises."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "Evening. Mory's roof, Kaloum."
       }
      ],
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "My antenna picks up its energy spikes. Two bars of signal, but it works."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "text": "LOADING... (40 s)"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "40 seconds loading time. That's my mental training."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "VRRRMM"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#22d3ee"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Analyzing... Weak spot: left shoulder. Certainty: 87%."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#8b5cf6"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "I'm counting on you, tech guy!"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#22d3ee"
      },
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "CRACK!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "fshhh..."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "I'm no fighter. I'm just the guy who knows WHERE to hit."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "text": "NEW ENERGY SPIKE",
       "label": "LIBRARY · 10 AM"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "It's planning something big. Tomorrow... where the books are kept."
       }
      ],
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "To be continued..."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "ch03": {
  "title": "The Voice of the Library",
  "pages": [
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "Library. 9:58 AM. It's raining."
       }
      ],
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "A derivative is the speed of the canoe at an exact moment. Not the whole trip: RIGHT NOW."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Whoaaa... okay, I get it now!"
       }
      ],
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "✦"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "It's her. My antennas go crazy when she speaks."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "No surprise: she's the only one who actually explains things well."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "10:00 AM."
       }
      ],
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "CRRRK"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "FWOOOSH"
       }
      ],
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "The pages of the books are turning blank, one by one."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Nobody move. Just breathe."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#7c3aed"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "He's too fast!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#e879f9"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "The Oblivion is like a tide: it only takes what isn't anchored. ANCHOR YOURSELVES!"
       }
      ],
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "♪"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "BAM!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "Later."
       }
      ],
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Before, people said I made everything complicated."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "You, you make things simple. Join us."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "“Fine. But I'm the one writing the summaries.” — Nia"
       },
       {
        "text": "The next day, 5:40 AM. The corniche."
       },
       {
        "text": "To be continued..."
       }
      ],
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "ZIIIP"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "ch04": {
  "title": "Lightning on the Corniche",
  "pages": [
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "Corniche, 5:40 AM. Team training (Kaï's brilliant idea)."
       }
      ],
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Why... are we running... before the sun is even up?!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "ZOOM!"
       }
      ],
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Too slow!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#c6ff3d"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "What was THAT?!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Sora. 10k before class. Plus 200 flashcards in the taxi."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "200 flashcards?!"
       },
       {
        "text": "A little bit every day: your brain locks it in."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "SHHRAAA"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#c6ff3d"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "He's targeting that girl over there!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Way too far! We'll never make it!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "ZZZIIIIP"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#26330f"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Left! Right! Left! It's all about rhythm, just like my flashcards."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#22d3ee"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "NOW! Together!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#7c3aed"
      },
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "BADABOOM!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "You'd make a legendary memory guardian."
       },
       {
        "text": "That sounds epic. I'm in!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "QUIZ TOURNAMENT — Undefeated Champion: REN"
       },
       {
        "text": "To be continued..."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "ch05": {
  "title": "The Rival",
  "pages": [
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "bg": {
       "text": "FINALS"
      },
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "Lecture Hall B. Quiz Tournament. The finals."
       }
      ],
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "LET'S GOOO!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Another win in the bag. Next."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "We're looking for top players. Join our squad."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "I'm strong BECAUSE I work alone."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#8b5cf6"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Then challenge me to a duel. If I win, you listen to us!"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "bg": {
       "text": "DUEL"
      }
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "10 to 7. Go home, \"sensei\"."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "text": "ERROR"
      },
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "VRRRMM"
       }
      ],
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "The crowd clears out. But Ren doesn't budge."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#ff5a3d"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "I DO NOT need help!"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#7c3aed"
      },
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "SKRATCH"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Even the greatest fighters have a coach, you know."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Tch. Come back when you actually know how to win."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "That night. Alone."
       },
       {
        "text": "To be continued..."
       }
      ],
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "It's nothing. It'll fade. No one can know."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "ch06": {
  "title": "The Kaloum Dojo",
  "pages": [
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "A courtyard in Kaloum turned into a dojo. Late afternoon."
       }
      ],
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "PRRRT !"
       }
      ],
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Exercise 4 ! Show your work step by step !"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "She's got a whistle. Why does she have a whistle ?"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Because here, we train for real. Welcome to the dojo !"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "We're putting together a squad against the Void. We need a coach."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "A coach ? I've never needed a method in my life."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#ffc53d"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Ren. Fast... and still skipping your steps."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#ff5a3d"
      },
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "I get the right answer, that's all that matters !"
       }
      ],
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "GRR"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "Sparring match. First to three hits."
       }
      ],
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "SWISH"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bg": {
       "lines": "#3a2a0a"
      },
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "CLACK !"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "On the exam, an answer with no steps is a zero."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "... Tch."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "That scar on her arm..."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "So, coach ?"
       },
       {
        "text": "Tomorrow, 6 AM. Late = 20 push-ups."
       },
       {
        "text": "6 AM ?!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "captions": [
       {
        "text": "9:07 PM. The whole city of Conakry plunges into darkness."
       },
       {
        "text": "To be continued..."
       }
      ],
      "sfx": [
       {
        "text": "CLICK."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 }
